{"title":"Silverhide Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 46) · Monster drop: Ogre Charger, Young Red Dragon, Harpy, The Broodmother</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2344 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/silver-hide\">Silver Hide</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"harpy-broodmother\" title=\"The Broodmother - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d4f85c8142062804f4e8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Broodmother</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"harpy\" title=\"Harpy - dropped it in 1 of 200 looted corpses (1/200)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/678b44f534ffde7b2c53.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/200<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 410 looted corpses (1/410)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/410<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 723 looted corpses (1/723)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/723<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silverhide-feet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-hide\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Hide</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/92c0036a438d222d1832.svg\" alt=\"Silverhide Feet\"></div><h3>Silverhide Feet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 46</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/23/2026, 9:37:19 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}